const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究每日公开报道新闻数量与市场总体活动（包括成交量和收益）之间的关系。 阅读时应将其放回原始样本、时点和制度环境中理解，不能把问题本身当作跨市场结论。",en:"The article studies the relation between the daily number of publicly reported news announcements and aggregate market activity, including trading volume and returns. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它把带日期的新闻计数与总体市场变量关联，并控制日历效应、新闻重要性代理、预定宏观公告及部分非信息型活动。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中任一选择，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It relates a dated news-count measure to aggregate market variables while controlling for calendar effects, news importance proxies, scheduled macro announcements, and selected noninformation activity. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要原新闻来源范围与时间戳、文章分类、总体市场收益和成交量、交易日历、控制事件、发布时间，以及转载和重复故事的处理。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选必须与原研究分开记录，不能因变量同名或使用最新修订值便视为可比。",en:"Inputs include the original news-source universe and timestamps, article classification, aggregate market returns and volume, trading calendar, control events, publication timing, and treatment of duplicated or syndicated stories. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"来源记录了有边界的相关关系，并强调将市场活动和波动与可观测信息关联的困难；它不说明原始新闻量衡量信息质量或造成可交易价格变动。 它只支持来源描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The source documents a bounded association and emphasizes the difficulty of linking activity and volatility to observed information; it does not say that raw news volume measures information quality or causes a tradeable move. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留来源覆盖和首次可见时间；区分公司和市场新闻；去重转载；对齐发布和市场时钟；预定义控制事件；检验日历和选择敏感性。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Retain source coverage and first-seen time; distinguish firm and market news; deduplicate syndication; align publication and market clocks; predefine control events; and test calendar and selection sensitivity. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance · DOI record。历史新闻库和总体市场环境不能验证当前情绪标签、再分发权利或实时交易规则。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance · DOI record. A historical news database and aggregate-market setting cannot validate current sentiment labels, redistribution rights, or a real-time trading rule. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.1994.tb00083.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance · DOI record · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“The Impact of Public Information on the Stock Market”公开说明的研究对象、设计与适用边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。历史新闻库和总体市场环境不能验证当前情绪标签、再分发权利或实时交易规则。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “The Impact of Public Information on the Stock Market”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
